* DESIGN-PLAN planner-finish witness: a function with locals and arithmetic, a conditional capture, a replacement and a match value
        DEFINE('F(A,B)C')                        :(FEND)
F       C = A + B * 2
        F = C - 1                                :(RETURN)
FEND    X = F(3, 4)
        S = 'hello world'
        S ('world' | 'hello') . W
        OUTPUT = X ' ' W
        T = 'aXbXc'
        T 'X' = '-'
        OUTPUT = T
        OUTPUT = (S ? 'hello') 'ok'
        I = 0
LOOP    I = LT(I, 3) I + 1                       :F(DONE)
        OUTPUT = F(I, I)                         :(LOOP)
DONE
END
